@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF8
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF8
  BorderColor #C9B9A2
  ArrowColor #8A7A67
  FontColor #2B241B
  FontSize 12
}
title 第四种适配形态：继承 + 两个 mixin，宿主那份原样留着
class "PDBackend" as H <<宿主 · 1087 行 · push>>
class "AscendPDSenderMixin" as S <<578 行>>
class "AscendPDReceiverMixin" as R <<463 行>>
class "AscendPDBackend" as B <<338 行>>
class "AscendAllocResponse" as M1 <<继承宿主>>
class "PullReadyNotif" as M2 <<新>>
class "PullReadyDoneAck" as M3 <<新>>
class "PullDoneSignal" as M4 <<新>>
H <|-- B
S <|-- B
R <|-- B
note bottom of B
  三个父类并列：两个 mixin 提供 pull 协议的两半，
  宿主类提供 push 那套与全部既有能力。
end note
note right of M2
  pull 协议的发起消息，
  带 sender 的缓冲 UUID 与 done_url。
end note
@enduml
